    IF `the act is done pursuant to an order of Court made under section 210`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits ... (d) anything done pursuant to an order of Court made under section 210" {F-A7}

-- (8)(e): anything done under an arrangement made pursuant to section 178 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018 (a borrowed Act: the fact is supplied).
