    IF `the act is done under an arrangement made pursuant to section 178 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits ... (e) anything done under an arrangement made pursuant to section 178 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018" {F-A7}

