GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(8)(f) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is done under an arrangement binding on creditors under section 187 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` MEANS
    IF `the act is done under an arrangement made between the company and its creditors` AND `the arrangement is binding on the creditors by virtue of section 187 of the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018`
    THEN JUST TRUE
