-- (8)(g): where a corporation is a borrowing corporation by reason that it is or will be under a liability to repay moneys received or to be received by it,
-- (i) the giving, in good faith and in the ordinary course of commercial dealing, by a company that is a subsidiary of the borrowing corporation, of a guarantee in
-- relation to the repayment of those moneys, whether or not secured by a charge over the property of that company; or (ii) the provision, in good faith and in the
-- ordinary course of commercial dealing, by a company that is a subsidiary of the borrowing corporation, of security in relation to the repayment of those moneys.
-- "Borrowing corporation" is the keel's s 4(1) function; "subsidiary" is its s 5(1) function over the three limbs.
-- src:7436 | (8) Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits —
-- src:7465 | (g) where a corporation is a borrowing corporation by reason
-- src:7466 | that it is or will be under a liability to repay moneys
-- src:7467 | received or to be received by it —
-- src:7469 | (i) the giving, in good faith and in the ordinary course of
-- src:7470 | commercial dealing, by a company that is a
-- src:7471 | subsidiary of the borrowing corporation, of a
-- src:7472 | guarantee in relation to the repayment of those
-- src:7473 | moneys, whether or not the guarantee is secured by
-- src:7474 | any charge over the property of that company; or
-- src:7476 | (ii) the provision, in good faith and in the ordinary
-- src:7477 | course of commercial dealing, by a company that is a
-- src:7478 | subsidiary of the borrowing corporation, of security
-- src:7479 | in relation to the repayment of those moneys;
@ref s 76(8)(g) (src:7436-7479)
GIVEN `the corporation is or will be under a liability (whether or not present or future) to repay money` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the money was received, or is to be received, by the corporation in response to an invitation to the public to subscribe for or purchase debentures of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the other corporation controls the composition of the board of the firstmentioned corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the other corporation controls more than half of the voting power of the firstmentioned corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the firstmentioned corporation is a subsidiary of a corporation which is the other corporation's subsidiary` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act is the giving, by the company, of a guarantee in relation to the repayment of those moneys` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act is the provision, by the company, of security in relation to the repayment of those moneys` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act was done in good faith` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(8)(g) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a guarantee or security by a subsidiary of a borrowing corporation` MEANS
    IF     (`s 4(1) "borrowing corporation" the corporation is a borrowing corporation` `the corporation is or will be under a liability (whether or not present or future) to repay money` `the money was received, or is to be received, by the corporation in response to an invitation to the public to subscribe for or purchase debentures of the corporation` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
       AND (`s 5(1) the corporation is deemed to be a subsidiary of the other corporation` `the other corporation controls the composition of the board of the firstmentioned corporation` `the other corporation controls more than half of the voting power of the firstmentioned corporation` `the firstmentioned corporation is a subsidiary of a corporation which is the other corporation's subsidiary` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
       AND (`the act is the giving, by the company, of a guarantee in relation to the repayment of those moneys` OR `the act is the provision, by the company, of security in relation to the repayment of those moneys`)
       AND `the act was done in good faith`
       AND `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits ... (g) where a corporation is a borrowing corporation by reason that it is or will be under a liability to repay moneys ... (i) the giving, in good faith and in the ordinary course of commercial dealing, by a company that is a subsidiary of the borrowing corporation, of a guarantee ...; or (ii) the provision ... of security" {F-A7}

-- (8)(ga): the giving by a company, in good faith and in the ordinary course of commercial dealing, of any representation, warranty or indemnity in relation to an offer to the
-- public of, or an invitation to the public to subscribe for or purchase, shares or units of shares in that company.
-- src:7436 | (8) Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits —
-- src:7481 | (ga) the giving by a company in good faith and in the ordinary
-- src:7482 | course of commercial dealing of any representation,
-- src:7483 | warranty or indemnity in relation to an offer to the
-- src:7484 | public of, or an invitation to the public to subscribe for or
-- src:7485 | purchase, shares or units of shares in that company;
@ref s 76(8)(ga) (src:7436-7485)
GIVEN `the act is the giving by the company of a representation, warranty or indemnity` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the representation, warranty or indemnity is in relation to an offer to the public of, or an invitation to the public to subscribe for or purchase, shares or units of shares in that company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act was done in good faith` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(8)(ga) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a representation, warranty or indemnity on an offer to the public` MEANS
    IF    `the act is the giving by the company of a representation, warranty or indemnity`
      AND `the representation, warranty or indemnity is in relation to an offer to the public of, or an invitation to the public to subscribe for or purchase, shares or units of shares in that company`
      AND `the act was done in good faith`
      AND `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits ... (ga) the giving by a company in good faith and in the ordinary course of commercial dealing of any representation, warranty or indemnity in relation to an offer to the public" {F-A7}

