    IF `the act is the purchase by the company of shares in the company pursuant to an order of a Court`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits ... (h) the purchase by a company of shares in the company pursuant to an order of a Court" {F-A7}

-- (8)(i): the creation or acquisition, in good faith and in the ordinary course of commercial dealing, by a company of a lien on shares in the company (other than
-- fully-paid shares) for any amount payable to the company in respect of the shares.
-- src:7436 | (8) Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits —
-- src:7493 | (i) the creation or acquisition, in good faith and in the ordinary
-- src:7494 | course of commercial dealing, by a company of a lien on
-- src:7495 | shares in the company (other than fully‑paid shares) for
-- src:7496 | any amount payable to the company in respect of the
-- src:7497 | shares;
@ref s 76(8)(i) (src:7436-7497)
GIVEN `the act is the creation or acquisition by the company of a lien on shares in the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares are fully paid` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the lien is for an amount payable to the company in respect of the shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act was done in good faith` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(8)(i) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` MEANS
    IF    `the act is the creation or acquisition by the company of a lien on shares in the company`
      AND (NOT `the shares are fully paid`)
      AND `the lien is for an amount payable to the company in respect of the shares`
      AND `the act was done in good faith`
      AND `the act was done in the ordinary course of commercial dealing`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits ... (i) the creation or acquisition, in good faith and in the ordinary course of commercial dealing, by a company of a lien on shares in the company (other than fully-paid shares)" -- "(other than X)" is one of the six case-by-case questions of 2026-11-05: the paragraph does not reach a lien on fully-paid shares, and says nothing of it {F-A7}

