-- (8)(m): the payment of some or all of the costs by a company listed on an approved exchange in Singapore or any securities exchange outside Singapore associated with a
-- scheme, an arrangement or a plan under which any shareholder may purchase or sell shares for the sole purpose of rounding off any odd-lots which the shareholder owns.
-- src:7436 | (8) Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits —
-- src:7509 | (m) the payment of some or all of the costs by a company listed
-- src:7510 | on an approved exchange in Singapore or any securities
-- src:7511 | exchange outside Singapore associated with a scheme, an
-- src:7512 | arrangement or a plan under which any shareholder of the
-- src:7513 | company may purchase or sell shares for the sole purpose
-- src:7514 | of rounding off any odd‑lots which the shareholder owns,
@ref s 76(8)(m) (src:7436-7514)
GIVEN `the company has been admitted to the official list of an approved exchange in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company has been removed from that official list` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is listed on a securities exchange outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act is the payment of some or all of the costs associated with the scheme, arrangement or plan` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the scheme, arrangement or plan is one under which any shareholder of the company may purchase or sell shares for the sole purpose of rounding off any odd-lots which the shareholder owns` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(8)(m) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is the payment of the costs of an odd-lot scheme` MEANS
    IF    (    (`s 4(1) "listed" the company or corporation is listed` `the company has been admitted to the official list of an approved exchange in Singapore` `the company has been removed from that official list` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
            OR `the company is listed on a securities exchange outside Singapore`)
      AND `the act is the payment of some or all of the costs associated with the scheme, arrangement or plan`
      AND `the scheme, arrangement or plan is one under which any shareholder of the company may purchase or sell shares for the sole purpose of rounding off any odd-lots which the shareholder owns`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits ... (m) the payment of some or all of the costs by a company listed on an approved exchange in Singapore or any securities exchange outside Singapore associated with a scheme ... for the sole purpose of rounding off any odd-lots" {F-A7}

-- (8)(n), (o): "but nothing in this subsection (n) is to be construed as implying that a particular act of a company would, but for this subsection, be prohibited by
-- subsection (1) or (1A); or (o) is to be construed as limiting the operation of any rule of law permitting the giving of financial assistance by a company, the
-- acquisition of shares or units of shares by a company or the lending of money by a company on the security of shares or units of shares."
-- src:7516 | but nothing in this subsection —
-- src:7518 | (n) is to be construed as implying that a particular act of a
-- src:7519 | company would, but for this subsection, be prohibited by
-- src:7520 | subsection (1) or (1A); or
@ref s 76(8)(n) (src:7516-7520)
GIVEN `the act is one that subsection (8) names` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(8)(n) subsection (8) implies that the act would otherwise be prohibited by subsection (1) or (1A)` MEANS
    IF `the act is one that subsection (8) names`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "nothing in this subsection (n) is to be construed as implying that a particular act of a company would, but for this subsection, be prohibited by subsection (1) or (1A)" (a flat negative, ruling N2 of 2026-11-04)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the saving speaks of "this subsection", that is of the acts subsection (8) names

-- src:7516 | but nothing in this subsection —
-- src:7522 | (o) is to be construed as limiting the operation of any rule of
-- src:7523 | law permitting the giving of financial assistance by a
-- src:7524 | company, the acquisition of shares or units of shares by a
-- src:7525 | company or the lending of money by a company on the
-- src:7526 | security of shares or units of shares.
@ref s 76(8)(o) (src:7516-7526)
GIVEN `the act is one that subsection (8) names` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(8)(o) subsection (8) limits the operation of a rule of law permitting the act` MEANS
    IF `the act is one that subsection (8) names`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "nothing in this subsection (o) is to be construed as limiting the operation of any rule of law permitting the giving of financial assistance by a company, the acquisition of shares or units of shares by a company or the lending of money by a company on the security of shares or units of shares" (a flat negative, ruling N2 of 2026-11-04)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the saving speaks of "this subsection", that is of the acts subsection (8) names

§ `Section 76(9): the exceptions for banks, employees and buy-backs`

-- (9)(a): the making of a loan, or the giving of a guarantee or the provision of security in connection with one or more loans made by one or more other persons, by a company
-- in the ordinary course of its business where the activities of that company are regulated by any written law relating to banking, finance companies or insurance or are subject
-- to supervision by the Monetary Authority of Singapore and where (i) the lending of money, or the giving of guarantees or the provision of security in connection with loans made by
-- other persons, is done in the course of such activities; and (ii) the loan made by the company, or the loan guaranteed or secured, is made on ordinary commercial terms as to the
-- rate of interest, the terms of repayment of principal and payment of interest, the security to be provided and otherwise.
-- src:7548 | (9) Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits —
-- src:7550 | (a) the making of a loan, or the giving of a guarantee or the
-- src:7551 | provision of security in connection with one or more loans
-- src:7552 | made by one or more other persons, by a company in the
-- src:7553 | ordinary course of its business where the activities of that
-- src:7554 | company are regulated by any written law relating to
-- src:7555 | banking, finance companies or insurance or are subject to
-- src:7556 | supervision by the Monetary Authority of Singapore and
-- src:7557 | where —
-- src:7559 | (i) the lending of money, or the giving of guarantees or
-- src:7560 | the provision of security in connection with loans
-- src:7561 | made by other persons, is done in the course of such
-- src:7562 | activities; and
-- src:7564 | (ii) the loan that is made by the company, or, where the
-- src:7565 | guarantee is given or the security is provided in
-- src:7566 | respect of a loan, that loan is made on ordinary
-- src:7567 | commercial terms as to the rate of interest, the terms
-- src:7568 | of repayment of principal and payment of interest,
-- src:7569 | the security to be provided and otherwise;
@ref s 76(9)(a) (src:7548-7569)
GIVEN `the act is the making of a loan, or the giving of a guarantee or the provision of security in connection with one or more loans made by one or more other persons` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the act is done by the company in the ordinary course of its business` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the activities of the company are regulated by a written law relating to banking, finance companies or insurance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the activities of the company are subject to supervision by the Monetary Authority of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the lending of money, or the giving of guarantees or the provision of security in connection with loans made by other persons, is done in the course of those activities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the loan made by the company, or the loan the guarantee or security is given in respect of, is made on ordinary commercial terms as to the rate of interest, the terms of repayment of principal and payment of interest, the security to be provided and otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(9)(a) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is ordinary banking, finance or insurance business` MEANS
    IF    `the act is the making of a loan, or the giving of a guarantee or the provision of security in connection with one or more loans made by one or more other persons`
      AND `the act is done by the company in the ordinary course of its business`
      AND (    `the activities of the company are regulated by a written law relating to banking, finance companies or insurance`
            OR `the activities of the company are subject to supervision by the Monetary Authority of Singapore`)
      AND `the lending of money, or the giving of guarantees or the provision of security in connection with loans made by other persons, is done in the course of those activities`
      AND `the loan made by the company, or the loan the guarantee or security is given in respect of, is made on ordinary commercial terms as to the rate of interest, the terms of repayment of principal and payment of interest, the security to be provided and otherwise`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits (a) the making of a loan ... where the activities of that company are regulated by any written law relating to banking, finance companies or insurance or are subject to supervision by the Monetary Authority of Singapore and where (i) ...; and (ii) ..." {F-A7}

-- (9)(b): the giving by a company of financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in the company
-- or in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company to be held by or for the benefit of employees of the company or of a corporation that is related to the company,
-- including any director holding a salaried employment or office in the company or in the corporation. "Related corporation" is the keel's s 4(1) function (the s 6 answer as one fact).
-- src:7548 | (9) Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits —
-- src:7571 | (b) the giving by a company of financial assistance for the
-- src:7572 | purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition or
-- src:7573 | proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in the
-- src:7574 | company or in a holding company or ultimate holding
-- src:7575 | company (as the case may be) of the company to be held by
-- src:7576 | or for the benefit of employees of the company or of a
-- src:7577 | corporation that is related to the company, including any
-- src:7578 | director holding a salaried employment or office in the
-- src:7579 | company or in the corporation; or
@ref s 76(9)(b) (src:7548-7579)
GIVEN `the act is the giving by the company of financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in the company or in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of employees of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of employees of a corporation that is related to the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the other corporation is deemed to be related to the corporation by virtue of section 6` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of a director holding a salaried employment or office in the company or in the related corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(9)(b) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is assistance for the acquisition of shares for employees` MEANS
    IF    `the act is the giving by the company of financial assistance for the purpose of, or in connection with, the acquisition or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in the company or in a holding company or ultimate holding company of the company`
      AND (    `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of employees of the company`
            OR (    `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of employees of a corporation that is related to the company`
                AND (`s 4(1) "related corporation" the other corporation is a related corporation of the corporation` `the other corporation is deemed to be related to the corporation by virtue of section 6` EQUALS JUST TRUE))
            OR `the shares or units of shares are to be held by or for the benefit of a director holding a salaried employment or office in the company or in the related corporation`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits (b) the giving by a company of financial assistance ... to be held by or for the benefit of employees of the company or of a corporation that is related to the company, including any director holding a salaried employment or office" {F-A7}

-- (9)(c): the purchase or acquisition or proposed purchase or acquisition by a company of its own shares in accordance with sections 76B to 76G (another part: taken as a fact).
-- src:7548 | (9) Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits —
-- src:7581 | (c) the purchase or acquisition or proposed purchase or
-- src:7582 | acquisition by a company of its own shares in
-- src:7583 | accordance with sections 76B to 76G.
@ref s 76(9)(c) (src:7548-7583)
GIVEN `the purchase or acquisition, or proposed purchase or acquisition, by the company of its own shares is in accordance with sections 76B to 76G` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(9)(c) the act is one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a buy-back in accordance with sections 76B to 76G` MEANS
    IF `the purchase or acquisition, or proposed purchase or acquisition, by the company of its own shares is in accordance with sections 76B to 76G`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "Nothing in subsection (1) or (1A) prohibits ... (c) the purchase or acquisition ... by a company of its own shares in accordance with sections 76B to 76G" -- whether the buy-back is in accordance with those sections is another part's question; a buy-back not in accordance with them is not made lawful by this paragraph {F-A7}
